Chapter: CircularSelf

 Adversarial probe: a self-referential proof term for a FALSE
 proposition. If this compiles, the proof layer accepts circular
 justification and any proposition is provable.

Section: Types

  Nat =
   | Zero
   | Succ (Nat)

Section: Proofs

  bad : Zero === Succ Zero
  bad = bad

Section: Main

  opening : [Console] Nothing
  opening = act
   print-line-uni "circular self proof accepted"
  end
